# .claudeignore - reference patterns, not an active Claude Code ignore file
# Claude Code does not enforce .claudeignore; these patterns do not stop it
# from reading credentials or other files. See its official permissions docs:
# https://code.claude.com/docs/en/permissions#read-and-edit
# To restrict Claude Code's Read tool, configure Read deny rules under
# permissions.deny in .claude/settings.json (or managed settings).
# Such rules are tool-specific; they are not an OS or shell sandbox.
# The repository verifier only checks that these patterns are present.

# Database files
**/bridge.db
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3

# Environment files
**/*.env*

# Credentials & Keys
**/*.pem
**/*.der
**/*.key
**/id_rsa*
**/id_dsa*
**/id_ed25519*
**/id_ecdsa*
**/*accessKeys.csv
device_key.json
identity.json
.env.local
.env.*.local
bridge_config.json
